#. Connect page, Advanced Mode, the connection inspector and an Activity row's menu: added to a rule button's name for screen readers, after its label, while the button's rule is in force: pressing it removes the rule. Lowercase: it follows a comma.
msgctxt "adv_rule_active"
msgid "rule active, click to remove"
msgstr "הכלל פעיל, לחץ כדי להסיר"

#. Connect page, Advanced Mode, the connection inspector and an Activity row's menu: the confirmation after a press removed the rule that was in force for the connection's host.
msgctxt "adv_rule_removed"
msgid "Rule removed"
msgstr "הכלל הוסר"

#. Split rules sheet: placeholder and accessible name of the search field above the Activity list. Typing filters the list to the connections whose host name or IP address contains the text; the rules above are not filtered.
msgctxt "adv_search_activity_placeholder"
msgid "Search activity"
msgstr "חיפוש בפעילות"

#. Connect page, Activity pane: placeholder and accessible name of the search field above the list of connections. Typing filters the list to the connections whose host name or IP address contains the text.
